<!--
  The adaptive icon's foreground: the mark ALONE, on transparency.

  The plate belongs to the background layer, which the launcher masks to the device's own shape.
  Carrying a plate here as well drew our rounded square inside the system's, so the icon read as two
  nested rounded squares with a small mark in the middle (#87).

  Geometry matches @drawable/ic_launcher_monochrome exactly, so the coloured icon and the themed one
  are the same mark at the same size and only the colour differs. The translate centres the mark's
  OWN bounds, which sit a little above and left of the viewport centre, so it has to be recomputed
  whenever the scale changes.
  -->
